                         pReSENtS tAI Wh0 V1.1


                    WRIttEN by rEdCR0W ^tAI/^Area51

History
~~~~~~~
V1.0: 
~~~~~
Cool version but it's got a bug -> It worked only on the 
1st node of your bbs 8-( !

V1.1:
~~~~~
Bugfixed version -> It works on all nodes of your bbs without any probs !

Introduction
~~~~~~~~~~~~
tAI Wh0 is a C00l Who-Tool which displays : PortNumber, 
                                            Modem, 
                                            Handle, 
                                            CPS, 
                                            LogonTime of a User, 
                                            Location/Group,
                                            Action,
                                            Accesslevel
                                            and a special Flag
                                            [VIP, NEW, Nor, 
                                            M(anagement)]
Installation
~~~~~~~~~~~~
[Delete the old version (V1.0) of tAi-wh0 !]  
Copy the file "tAI-Wh0.rexx" to your pfiles.
Load your BBSMenu and change following: 

2; Available everywhere
	2WHo
        .        
        .       
        . 
        WHo | #0pfiles:tAI-Wh0.rexx}      <--Add it at the end of 
                                              the Available everywhere Menu!
              ^
              |
              `Ctrl-Q 


Load your prefered texteditor and CONFIGURE "tAI-Wh0.rexx" !!!

THAT'S ALL ! [Easy isn't it ??? 8-)]


